    [Test] Disable fabric memory for Qwen3-30B accuracy case (#18735)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    
    The Qwen3-30B-A3B KV Cache Pool accuracy case
    (`tests/e2e/cases/features/kv_pool/test_qwen3_30b_acc.py`) enables
    `ASCEND_ENABLE_USE_FABRIC_MEM=1` as part of its Ascend env config. This
    PR sets
    it to `0`, so the case no longer enables Ascend fabric memory.
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    
    No. It only changes the environment of an E2E accuracy test case.
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    
    Not run locally. The case is exercised by the periodic CI entry
    `qwen3-30b-acc`
    (linux-aarch64-a3-800i-4) in `nightly_config.yaml` /
    `weekly_config.yaml`.
    
    
    - vLLM main:
    https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/commit/c4df37dfcc7f72ca41cd43801a468526ecf99a2b
    
    ---------
    
    Signed-off-by: Fanfive5 <wf337845818@gmail.com>

